From 622f04e97415e62bd2ab61f7a27e7a296e8467b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas Gleixner <tglx@kernel.org>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 21:06:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04043/15333] ptrace, treewide: Rename
 ptrace_report_syscall_entry() to ptrace_report_syscall_permit_entry()

The return value of that function is boolean and tells the caller whether
to permit the syscall processing or not.

Rename the function so the purpose is clear and make the return type bool.

Signed-off-by: Thomas Gleixner <tglx@kernel.org>
Tested-by: Mukesh Kumar Chaurasiya (IBM) <mkchauras@gmail.com>
